"features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: EH55-H1K3","c":[]},{"h":"Rated Capacity: 1KVA/1KW","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Type: Lead Acid Battery","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Capacity: 3*12V/7Ah","c":[]},{"h":"Input Voltage: 208/220/230/240VAC","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Specification","active":true,"cls":"tab-1","noExpand":false,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Description","active":false,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h3>The Must EH55-H1K3 1KVA <a href=\"/ups-and-ips/online-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Online UPS</a> is a high-performance double-conversion UPS designed to keep your sensitive devices protected from power failures, voltage fluctuations, and electrical noise. With its pure sine wave output and advanced online technology, this UPS provides clean, stable, and continuous power for computers, servers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, and office electronics.</h3><p><br></p><p>This model delivers zero transfer time, meaning your devices remain unaffected during sudden outages. It supports a wide input voltage range (110V–300V), making it highly suitable for unstable power conditions. The Must EH55-H1K3 includes built-in maintenance-free batteries, ensuring dependable backup time for safe shutdown or short-duration operation.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring an LCD display, compact body, and intelligent protection features, this 1KVA online UPS is an excellent choice for both home and office environments requiring reliable power security.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>1KVA / 1KW True Online Double-Conversion UPS</li><li>Pure Sine Wave Output for sensitive equipment</li><li>Zero Transfer Time during power failure</li><li>Wide Input Voltage Range: 110V – 300V</li><li>Built-in sealed lead-acid batteries for stable backup</li><li>High-efficiency &amp; low noise operation</li><li>Ideal for PCs, servers, routers, switches, NAS &amp; CCTV</li><li>LCD Display fo